## The ancient city, its vault, and the rooms past the space warp.

## Room 53. LOOK.BAS 5300 and 5350.

create the City Enterance
  a room, dark while not lit-up
  room name:
    Enterance to city
  exits, one-way: north to the Hall of Doors, northeast to the City, out to the City

  passage to the Hall of Doors
    grammar
      door
  end passage

  You are at the enterance to a large and beautiful ancient city.

## Room 54. LOOK.BAS 5400 and 5450.

create the City
  a room, dark while not lit-up
  room name:
    City
  exits, one-way: north to the City Enterance, south to the Vault of City, northeast to the Space Warp Enterance, northwest to the Post Office

  You are in the center of the ancient city. there are enterable{br}
  buildings on your east, west, and south. There is a path to the{br}
  north, and a road goins NW, where it is written:{br}
  "You must have at least 380 points to travel{br}
  on this road."

## Room 54, southeast: code -10, line 3090. The score-gated road is the action `taking-the-road` in verbs.chord.

## Room 55. LOOK.BAS 5500 and 5550.

create the Post Office
  a room, dark while not lit-up
  room name:
    This was the post office for the ancient city.
  exits, one-way: south to the City

  This was the post office for the ancient city.

## Room 56. LOOK.BAS 5600 and 5650.

create the Space Warp Enterance
  a room, dark while not lit-up
  room name:
    Space warp enterance
  exits, one-way: north to the City, northeast to the Square Room, in to the Square Room

  You are at the south edge of the city. On your south is a{br}
  space warp, used for instant transportation in the city long ago.

## Room 57. LOOK.BAS 5700 and 5750.

create the Vault of City
  a room, dark while not lit-up
  room name:
    Vault of city
  exits, one-way: east to the City, south to the Square Room
  west to the North of Door, one-way while the vault is forced

  You are standing south of the vault of the ancient city, which{br}
  contains it's most valuable treasure. written on the vault:{br}
  "This vault is designed to keep out all human intruders.{br}
  anyone who attemps to open it will be immediately removed."

## Room 58. LOOK.BAS 5800 and 5850.

create the Square Room
  a room, dark while not lit-up
  room name:
    You are in a perfectly square room with exits in four directions.
  exits, one-way: north to the North One-Exit Passage, east to the Nameless Room, west to the West One-Exit Passage
  north is blocked while the North One-Exit Passage is entered: passage-blocked
  east is blocked while the Nameless Room is entered: passage-blocked
  west is blocked while the West One-Exit Passage is entered: passage-blocked

  You are in a perfectly square room with exits in four directions.

## Room 59. LOOK.BAS 5900 and 5950.

create the North One-Exit Passage
  a room, dark while not lit-up
  states: untrodden, entered
  room name:
    You are in a passage with only one exit.
  exits, one-way: north to the Observation Platform
  northeast is blocked: passage-blocked

  You are in a passage with only one exit.

  after the player entering
    change the North One-Exit Passage to entered when the North One-Exit Passage is untrodden
  end after

