## Room 87. LOOK.BAS 8700 and 8750.

create the Room 87
  a room, dark while not lit-up
  room name:
    You are in a room with four walls and no exits.

  You are in a room with four walls and no exits.

  after the player entering
    phrase woman-wants-laser
    move the woman to the Room 87
    set the player's lamp-life to 296
  end after

